-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §13 העסקה במשרה חלקית: a part-time teacher
-- works by the table of annex ג'; a change of up to 1% from the move to the
-- reform's week founds no claim.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-9`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-g`

§ `13 העסקה במשרה חלקית`

-- (א): a part-time teacher works by the table of the week of part-time
-- teachers annexed as annex ג' (oz-founding-annex-g): by his frontal hours,
-- with his homeroom and role hours, the week and the position the annex
-- and its notes give.
@ref akn:art_13__para_a
GIVEN `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `a part-time teacher's Oz week` `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours` IS
    `what annex ג' gives a teacher with` `frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours`

-- (ב): a change of up to 1% in the position, from an existing teacher's
-- move from the week in force on the eve of the signing to the reform's,
-- founds no claim of a breach of the commitment to the position. "עד 1%"
-- is the most the clause tolerates, so 1% is in (an exception to convention
-- thresholds.until); the change is in points (convention position.points).
@ref akn:art_13__para_b
GIVEN `the position before the move` IS A NUMBER, `the position after the move` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a part-time teacher's change of position founds a claim` `the position before the move` `the position after the move` IF
    `the position before the move` MINUS `the position after the move` GREATER THAN 1%
    OR `the position after the move` MINUS `the position before the move` GREATER THAN 1%

-- Annex ג' opens at §9's full position: §9(ו)'s week, §9(א)'s 40 hours.
#ASSERT `the week of the annexed table's full position` `the table of annex ג'` EQUALS JUST `the Oz full-position week`
#ASSERT `the full position's hours in the annexed table` `the table of annex ג'` EQUALS `the Oz position base`
#ASSERT `a part-time teacher's Oz week` 12 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 12 3 5) (50%) (50%))
#ASSERT NOT `a part-time teacher's change of position founds a claim` (50%) (49%)
#ASSERT `a part-time teacher's change of position founds a claim` (50%) (48.75%)
